  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& x_1(t)=\\frac{1}{2} a t^2 \\\\\n& x_2(t)=v t \\\\\n& x_1-x_2=\\frac{1}{2} a t^2-v t\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
